        },
        {
          "text": " Khu ndaalo eyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alirumikhira embalu yewe eye kamaani ne khukhwira Lefiatani okwo kukwikoniola ne khukhwibororaka ne khukhwira kusolo kukwamenya mu nyanja.",
          "type": "text",
