              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga endaalo eyo ne liola ekhoombi eliipwa, khulaanga Baisiraeli boosi bali mu mbaambe Ashuru ne Misiri bakobole. Balicha mala basaaye Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu Yerusalemu khu sikulu siewe sitakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
